ModuleEuVatLookupName = EU VAT Lookup
ModuleEuVatLookupDesc = Check an EU VAT number on VIES and fill the third party form
EuVatLookupDescription = Check an EU VAT number on VIES and fill the third party form
EuVatLookupDescriptionLong = Adds a button next to the VAT number on the third party form. The VAT number is checked on the official EU VIES service and the company name, address, zip, town and country are filled in the form. Empty fields are filled, fields with a different value are only changed after confirmation. Nothing is saved until you click Save.
